  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a grey memory scene, Purple tells Azure to hand Change Soul Immortal Gu and its immortal killer move to Mo Yao. If Azure fails the tribulation, an intact soul would still let him start over rapidly. Azure is the Shadow Sect name for Bo Qing in that stretch.",
